    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Lord Fenrir\u2019s Banquet!</strong><br>Now, now\u2014Lord Fenrir is waiting, stomach growling with anticipation!<br>Please, take your time and enjoy this feast to the fullest tonight...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, throw a carrot onto the stage!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you move the carrot near a rabbit, it will come closer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead the rabbit to Lord Fenrir.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed the rabbit to Lord Fenrir to increase your score!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power Up When the Gauge Is Full</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the on-screen gauge reaches MAX, you'll power up!<br>Carrots will become enhanced for a limited time, drawing rabbits from farther away.<br>Feeding multiple rabbits to Lord Fenrir at once is the key to charging the gauge faster!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More Rabbits Appear as You Level Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clearing each stage, achieving a high enough score will level you up!<br>As you level up, more rabbits will appear on the stage, allowing you to aim for even higher scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game supports mouse, keyboard, and controller input.</i></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Lord Fenrir\u2019s Banquet!</strong><br>Now, now\u2014Lord Fenrir is waiting, stomach growling with anticipation!<br>Please, take your time and enjoy this feast to the fullest tonight...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, throw a carrot onto the stage!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you move the carrot near a rabbit, it will come closer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead the rabbit to Lord Fenrir.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed the rabbit to Lord Fenrir to increase your score!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power Up When the Gauge Is Full</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the on-screen gauge reaches MAX, you'll power up!<br>Carrots will become enhanced for a limited time, drawing rabbits from farther away.<br>Feeding multiple rabbits to Lord Fenrir at once is the key to charging the gauge faster!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More Rabbits Appear as You Level Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clearing each stage, achieving a high enough score will level you up!<br>As you level up, more rabbits will appear on the stage, allowing you to aim for even higher scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game supports mouse, keyboard, and controller input.</i></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to Fenrir Banquet! Control the carrot to guide the rabbit to Fenrir and feed it! Can you satisfy Fenrir?",
